		{
			description: [
				"&6Forged from corrupted Netherite and animated by overwhelming force, the Netherite Monstrosity is a weapon that outlived its creators. Designed to be unstoppable, it was never meant to think—only to destroy."
				""
				"&eIn Atelier RPG’s world, the Monstrosity stands as proof that raw durability without control creates monsters, not protectors."
			]
			id: "5081BBC6A20A117F"
			rewards: [
